id: pm-github-px45
title: CHANGELOG omits the shipped --link-deps feature and mislabels 2026.7.23 work as Unreleased
description: "Found during a fleet-wide pm-changelog default-output parity audit. The last regeneration ran with stale local tags and before pm-github-hdai was closed, so the published CHANGELOG.md (a) never listed the --link-deps import feature that actually shipped in npm 2026.7.23, and (b) filed pm-github-wpit under '## Unreleased'. Both items closed before the v2026.07.23 tag boundary (hdai 2026-07-22T23:10:49Z, wpit 2026-07-22T19:41:58Z vs tag committer date 2026-07-23T06:12:30Z), so both belong to the 2026.7.23 section. Fix: git fetch --tags --force then npm run changelog:full. Root cause is the recurring stale-local-tags trap, not a pm-changelog defect (verified: the local build and the published build produce byte-identical output here)."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[4]: changelog,link-deps,release-hygiene,stale-tags
created_at: "2026-07-24T19:49:10.484Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-24T19:49:17.604Z"
closed_at: "2026-07-24T19:49:17.603Z"
author: claude-opus-5
resolution: "Ran git fetch --tags --force then npm run changelog:full, which added the missing pm-github-hdai (--link-deps) entry and moved it plus pm-github-wpit from '## Unreleased' into '## 2026.7.23 - 2026-07-23', matching the published npm release."
expected_result: "The published changelog credits the --link-deps import feature to the release that shipped it, and changelog:check stays green."
actual_result: "changelog:check reports 'Changelog is up to date'; the 2026.7.23 section now carries the Added entry for pm-github-hdai."
close_reason: Regenerated CHANGELOG.md with complete tag history; the --link-deps feature is now listed under 2026.7.23
body: ""
